			"Message": "docs(NamingConventions): Align table formatting in Core Modules section\n\nStandardize the column spacing and alignment of the Core Modules audit table in the GitHub Naming Conventions documentation. Adjusted the markdown table syntax to ensure uniform padding between cells, bringing it in line with the formatting used throughout the rest of document.\n\nThis change improves readability and ensures consistent rendering of the compliance status table across different markdown viewers and GitHub's web interface.",
