			"File": [
				"⠇⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1733,
				127
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Normalize import separation and consolidate module declarations\n\nStandardize import statements across the codebase by separating canonical library imports (e.g., `::Vine::Generated`, `::Cache`) from local `crate::` bindings. Apply the established two-line import pattern consistently in gRPC service handlers, lifecycle modules, and effect dispatchers.\n\nConsolidate module documentation by removing dead code and dormant scaffolding. Eliminate unused `TlsCommands`, `EmitWithTraceparent`, `RuntimeBuild`, `AirManagement`, `Connection`, `Commands`, `Configuration`, `Telemetry`, and other dormant RPC dispatch arms. Condense documentation summaries to focused descriptions of active functionality.\n\nAdd blank lines for improved readability in error handling blocks, lifecycle setup sequences, and terminal integration paths. Adjust `show_text_document` handler to use single-line consolidated imports for local modules and expand multi-line UUID generation calls to block style.\n\nThis cleanup reduces noise in the module tree, ensures only live code paths remain in scope, and establishes consistent formatting across the Mountain backend.",
			"SHA": "b0b0de4b4d1385a296a3e1153fbb6f60eca6c814"
		}
